"w":"cakes","s":348.66,"e":348.74,"line":92},{"w":"and","s":348.66,"e":348.94,"line":92},{"w":"make","s":348.94,"e":349.14,"line":92},{"w":"a","s":349.14,"e":349.58,"line":92},{"w":"wish","s":349.58,"e":349.66,"line":92},{"w":"beneath","s":349.58,"e":350.08,"line":92},{"w":"the","s":350.08,"e":350.38,"line":92},{"w":"summer","s":350.38,"e":350.64,"line":92},{"w":"sky—","s":350.64,"e":351.28,"line":92},{"w":"Happy","s":351.28,"e":351.72,"line":93},{"w":"birthday,","s":351.72,"e":352.22,"line":93},{"w":"Mike","s":352.6,"e":352.68,"line":93},{"w":"and","s":352.6,"e":352.88,"line":93},{"w":"Laura—","s":352.88,"e":353.4,"line":93},{"w":"Happy","s":353.4,"e":354.76,"line":94},{"w":"seventh","s":354.76,"e":355.26,"line":94},{"w":"of","s":355.26,"e":355.54,"line":94},{"w":"July—","s":355.54,"e":356.66,"line":94},{"w":"Wait!","s":356.66,"e":357.3,"line":95},{"w":"Not","s":357.32,"e":358.32,"line":95},{"w":"the","s":358.32,"e":358.58,"line":95},{"w":"seventh—","s":359.68,"e":360.46,"line":95},{"w":"**Seven-eleven!","s":360.46,"e":361.16,"line":96},{"w":"That’s","s":361.52,"e":361.6,"line":96},{"w":"July","s":361.68,"e":362.42,"line":96},{"w":"eleven,","s":362.42,"e":363.56,"line":96},{"w":"right!**","s":363.56,"e":365.18,"line":96},{"w":"Now","s":365.18,"e":365.86,"line":97},{"w":"bring","s":365.86,"e":366.08,"line":97},{"w":"back","s":366.08,"e":366.34,"line":97},{"w":"those","s":366.34,"e":366.62,"line":97},{"w":"berry","s":366.62,"e":366.96,"line":97},{"w":"cakes","s":366.96,"e":367.54,"line":97},{"w":"And","s":369.16,"e":369.6,"line":98},{"w":"party","s":369.6,"e":369.88,"line":98},{"w":"through","s":369.88,"e":370.28,"line":98},{"w":"the","s":370.28,"e":370.56,"line":98},{"w":"night!","s":370.56,"e":371.06,"line":98}],"lines":[{"s":0,"e":0.5,"text":"**[Intro]**"},{"s":4.68,"e":7.98,"text":"Seven-eleven, make a wish, let the birthday bells begin,"},{"s":7.98,"e":12.04,"text":"For Laura and for Mike—let the double-day win!"},{"s":12.04,"e":15.72,"text":"Two cakes, one date, one family delight,"},{"s":15.82,"e":21.44,"text":"A blueberry morning and a strawberry night!"},{"s":21.44,"e":21.94,"text":"**[Verse 1]**"},{"s":21.44,"e":25.7,"text":"Mike was working, wheels were turning, earning through the day,"},{"s":25.7,"e":29.46,"text":"Then he clocked out, rocked out, and hurried right away."},{"s":29.46,"e":33.52,"text":"He took Mom to the hospital, hopeful, holding tight,"},{"s":33.52,"e":37.42,"text":"While the summer sun was shining with that July light."},{"s":37.42,"e":41.54,"text":"Then Mike made a mission through the busy city streets,"},{"s":41.54,"e":45.2,"text":"Picked up little Brian from preschool in his seat."},{"s":45.2,"e":49.06,"text":"Back to the hospital, with excitement in the air,"},{"s":49,"e":53.32,"text":"A growing glow of love and hope was waiting for them there."},{"s":53.32,"e":53.82,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus]**"},{"s":53.32,"e":57.48,"text":"But Mom had a long labor—longer than a song,"},{"s":57.48,"e":61.16,"text":"Breathing, believing, brave and strong."},{"s":61.16,"e":65.24,"text":"The minutes moved slowly, then suddenly—bam!"},{"s":65.24,"e":71.92,"text":"At eleven in the morning, little Laura said, “Here I am!”"},{"s":71.92,"e":72.42,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":71.92,"e":76.18,"text":"Happy birthday, Laura! Happy birthday, Mike!"},{"s":76.18,"e":80.38,"text":"Born on the same day—now how wild is that alike?"},{"s":80.38,"e":83.54,"text":"Seven-eleven heaven, let the candles come alive,"},{"s":83.54,"e":88.46,"text":"Father and daughter sharing one sensational July!"},{"s":89.4,"e":92.96,"text":"Everybody says, “Hey! You stole my birthday!”"},{"s":93.36,"e":96.98,"text":"“Give it back! That date was mine first anyway!”"},{"s":96.98,"e":101.16,"text":"But when a dad and daughter share that birthday cheer,"},{"s":101.16,"e":106.38,"text":"Nobody stole a thing—they brought each other here!"},{"s":106.38,"e":106.88,"text":"**[Verse 2]**"},{"s":108.86,"e":113.26,"text":"Laura arrived at eleven, eleven A.M. bright,"},{"s":113.26,"e":116.96,"text":"A little bundle bubbling with laughter, love, and light."},{"s":116.96,"e":120.9,"text":"Mike had his birthday, but he gained a gift that day,"},{"s":120.9,"e":124.61,"text":"The greatest present possible in every single way."},{"s":125.08,"e":128.94,"text":"No ribbon, no wrapping, no box and no bow,"},{"s":128.94,"e":132.72,"text":"Just a beautiful baby with a radiant glow."},{"s":132.72,"e":136.84,"text":"From that moment every seventh month, eleventh day,"},{"s":136.84,"e":142.62,"text":"They could split the candles—but not the love away."},{"s":142.62,"e":143.12,"text":"**[Chorus]**"},{"s":142.62,"e":146.7,"text":"Happy birthday, Laura! Happy birthday, Mike!"},{"s":146.92,"e":151.14,"text":"Born on the same day—now how wild is that alike?"},{"s":151.14,"e":154.36,"text":"Seven-eleven heaven, let the candles come alive,"},{"s":154.6,"e":158.8,"text":"Father and daughter sharing one sensational July!"},{"s":159.78,"e":163.6,"text":"Everybody says, “Hey! You stole my birthday!”"},{"s":163.76,"e":167.76,"text":"“Give it back! That date was mine first anyway!”"},{"s":167.76,"e":172,"text":"But when a dad and daughter share that birthday cheer,"},{"s":172,"e":177.2,"text":"Nobody stole a thing—they brought each other here!"},{"s":177.2,"e":177.7,"text":"**[Verse 3 — 2026]**"},{"s":179.56,"e":184.06,"text":"Then came twenty-twenty-six, with frosting flying free,"},{"s":184.06,"e":187.6,"text":"A double-cake celebration for the birthday family."},{"s":188.2,"e":191.8,"text":"Dad had strawberry—sweet, scarlet, stacked up high,"},{"s":191.8,"e":195.98,"text":"Laura had blueberry, blue as a brilliant July sky."},{"s":195.98,"e":199.94,"text":"Strawberry for Mike with a bright berry crown,"},{"s":200.08,"e":203.84,"text":"Blueberry for Laura—pass the party plates around!"},{"s":203.84,"e":207.76,"text":"Red cake, blue cake, candles sparkling gold,"},{"s":207.76,"e":213.42,"text":"Another shared birthday and another story told."},{"s":213.42,"e":213.92,"text":"**[Bridge]**"},{"s":213.42,"e":217.54,"text":"Then Chris, Laura’s husband, said, “You won’t believe this twist—"},{"s":217.54,"e":221.18,"text":"I’ve got a friend whose birthday’s also on the list!”"},{"s":222,"e":225.06,"text":"Seven-eleven strikes again—another candle crew,"},{"s":225.06,"e":229.34,"text":"How can one July day hold so many birthdays too?"},{"s":229.6,"e":231.4,"text":"One says, “That’s my birthday!”"},{"s":231.52,"e":233.3,"text":"One says, “No, it’s mine!”"},{"s":233.54,"e":237.16,"text":"Everybody’s claiming ownership of seven-eleven time!"},{"s":237.16,"e":240.94,"text":"“It was stolen!” “It was borrowed!” “It was taken in the night!”"},{"s":240.94,"e":247.02,"text":"While the cakes keep disappearing with each delicious bite."},{"s":247.02,"e":247.52,"text":"**[Breakdown]**"},{"s":247.02,"e":251.24,"text":"But birthdays aren’t belongings, and dates cannot be owned,"},{"s":251.24,"e":254.86,"text":"They’re little lights of love through every year we’ve grown."},{"s":254.78,"e":258.86,"text":"Still, it’s fun to fuss and fight and make the playful claim:"},{"s":258.86,"e":260.84,"text":"“You copied my birthday!”"},{"s":260.94,"e":266.34,"text":"“You stole my special name!”"},{"s":266.34,"e":270.56,"text":"Yet father and daughter get the sweetest exception,"},{"s":270.56,"e":274.44,"text":"A shared celebration with a perfect connection."},{"s":274.44,"e":278.3,"text":"Mike didn’t lose his birthday when Laura came to stay—"},{"s":278.24,"e":283.94,"text":"She made his birthday brighter in the most miraculous way."},{"s":283.94,"e":284.44,"text":"**[Final Chorus]**"},{"s":284.04,"e":288.38,"text":"Happy birthday, Laura! Happy birthday, Mike!"},{"s":288.3,"e":292.1,"text":"Raise the roof with rhythm, make the birthday candles strike!"},{"s":292.4,"e":296.14,"text":"Seven-eleven heaven, double laughter, double light,"},{"s":296.34,"e":301.72,"text":"Blueberry and strawberry—what a beautiful sight!"},{"s":301.9,"e":306.26,"text":"Happy birthday, Laura! Happy birthday, Dad!"},{"s":306.54,"e":310,"text":"Celebrate the memories and every year you’ve had!"},{"s":310,"e":313.86,"text":"Chris and Brian, Mom and friends—come sing with all your might:"},{"s":315.72,"e":318.76,"text":"“Seven-eleven birthdays make the whole world bright!”"},{"s":318.76,"e":323.04,"text":"Everybody says, “Hey! You stole my birthday!”"},{"s":323.12,"e":326.94,"text":"But love just laughs and answers, “There is plenty anyway!”"},{"s":327.48,"e":331.34,"text":"And when a dad and daughter share the date from year to year,"},{"s":331.34,"e":334.08,"text":"Nobody stole the birthday—"},{"s":334,"e":336.76,"text":"They doubled all the cheer!"},{"s":336.76,"e":337.26,"text":"**[Outro]**"},{"s":339.32,"e":343.5,"text":"At eleven in the morning, Laura joined the family line,"},{"s":343.5,"e":347.5,"text":"On the very day that Mike could also call his special time."},{"s":347.5,"e":351.28,"text":"So cut the cakes and make a wish beneath the summer sky—"},{"s":351.28,"e":353.4,"text":"Happy birthday, Mike and Laura—"},{"s":353.4,"e":356.66,"text":"Happy seventh of July—"},{"s":356.66,"e":360.46,"text":"Wait! Not the seventh—"},{"s":360.46,"e":365.18,"text":"**Seven-eleven! That’s July eleven, right!**"},{"s":365.18,"e":367.54,"text":"Now bring back those berry cakes"},{"s":369.16,"e":371.06,"text":"And party through the night!"}],"duration":375.76,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-06T19:43:40.470Z","stats":{"whisperWords":750,"polishedWords":718,"matched":682,"matchRate":0.95}}